        <mxCell id="f5b" value="(src, dst, port, proto) → accept/drop&#10;evaluadas en orden de position&#10;comentario sm-fwd-user-&lt;id&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="230" y="750" width="360" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f5bacc" value="ACCEPT&#10;(regla coincide, accept)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="640" y="710" width="160" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f5bdrop" value="DROP&#10;(regla coincide, drop)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="640" y="770" width="160" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- DEFAULT DROP -->
        <mxCell id="def" value="6 · POLICY DROP  ·  log &quot;SM-FWD-DROP-DEFAULT&quot;&#10;sm-fwd-default-drop" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=#7a2e2b;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="260" y="900" width="340" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ===== FLECHAS principales ===== -->
        <mxCell id="e_pkt_chain" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pkt" target="chain"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_chain_f1" style="endArrow=block;html=1;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="chain" target="f1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>

